ompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a9e2019f77037f4a0c1b62fc076e5356 2x, https://si.imgix.net/83016c2a/uploads/origins/11ebdae7-451d-4a8c-85df-f9964c679e8e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d6e9a57f895106259c81da376e5f07f0 3x"}, "body": "丸五郎様、初めまして。\nもしよろしければ当方のTRPGの探索者と相方さんを描いて頂きたくリクエストの方を失礼致します。\nCOCシナリオ「AE」の探索者になります。\n(本文中にネタバレは含まれませんが、ドライブ資料には別フォルダに含まれます)\n\n①子供　アンネッタ\n11歳/149cm/男の娘　(ほとんど女の子に見える)\n子どもらしからぬ冷静さと聡明さ、年相応の少年らしい無邪気さと奔放さを併せ持っている。\n第二次性徴をまったく迎えていない少年です。\n\n②大人　ジルド\n26歳/190cm/男　瘦せ型\n皮肉屋で悲観的で不器用\n頬のコケは削除して頂いて大丈夫＆三白眼もアンネと比べて黒目が小さい程度でも大丈夫です。\n\n丸五郎様の素敵なイラストを拝見して、イラストの雰囲気などが素敵で是非二人のイラストをお願いできればと思いました！\n・2人で手を取り街で買い物を楽しんでいる様子（子どもが引っ張る形）\n・2人で追っ手から隠れて路地で息を潜めている様子\n・海の浅瀬or砂浜を2人で歩いている様子\n・子どもが椅子に座り地べたに座った大人を慰めているような構図（カルト的雰囲気で）\n上記のいずれか、またはお好きな様に描いて頂ければと思います！\nできれば手の大き差や体格差、雰囲気の差のいずれかがわかりやすいとより嬉しいです！\n\nもしよろしければご検討お願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1WwejYUh_ddFnONCbSvte7A4sK43VJwua", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@margot_431/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1755378, "client_id": 3015400, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0a266e4f/uploads/origins/5fb7e012-8785-4d90-a484-528e4f46622c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f27f3bb079654713cb4a3e3d59b1b95", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0a266e4f/uploads/origins/5fb7e012-8785-4d90-a484-528e4f46622c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f27f3bb079654713cb4a3e3d59b1b95, https://si.imgix.net/0a266e4f/uploads/origins/5fb7e012-8785-4d90-a484-528e4f46622c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68457d94bd739b39a27fa17c397539c5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0a266e4f/uploads/origins/5fb7e012-8785-4d90-a484-528e4f46622c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a666974cf0bfebc28141d3097998aa2 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0a266e4f/uploads/origins/5fb7e012-8785-4d90-a484-528e4f46622c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c945ac371e6920e9de1c87e6dba852c8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0a266e4f/uploads/origins/5fb7e012-8785-4d90-a484-528e4f46622c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c945ac371e6920e9de1c87e6dba852c8, https://si.imgix.net/0a266e4f/uploads/origins/5fb7e012-8785-4d90-a484-528e4f46622c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e37298513b343977fe281ec0d13a1e3e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0a266e4f/uploads/origins/5fb7e012-8785-4d90-a484-528e4f46622c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5359f443124cb57ddf382a9ea3fbc93b 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I love your art style and would like to request a drawing of my character.\n\nQuin (32):\n- A former villain who wants to repent, because he fears punishment from God, but doesn't know how.\n- His theme is a snake that is trying to shed its own skin, but gets stuck. Like an incomplete rebirth.\n- He's sarcastic, apathetic, and curt. He prefers to watch the world passively.\n- He works at an organization that fights supernatural creatures. He is a paramedic.\n- He has the power to destroy anything he touches, but his own body breaks down when he uses this ability. He lives in a lot of physical pain, believing he deserves it.\n- He burns photographs of his past.\n\nMotifs: decay, atrophy, regret, penance, burned photographs, scissors, and ouroboros.\n\nThank you for considering my request! ٩(｡•́‿•̀｡)۶\t\n\nReference images: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GqEaeurgmSPtar6TksJmF82P7nuf_j3q?usp=drive_link", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcode